   189→
   190→## 4. View Designs
   191→
   192→### 4.1 Dashboard (Home)
   193→
   194→The dashboard is a high-level overview, not a working view. It answers: "What's happening right now?"
   195→
   196→```
   197→┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   198→│ ACTIVE WORK                                            │
   199→│ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐    │
   200→│ │ ● Task Title │ │ ● Task Title │ │              │    │
   201→│ │ agent: worker│ │ agent: worker│ │  No active   │    │
   202→│ │ ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░░ │ │ ▓▓▓░░░░░░░░ │ │  work        │    │
   203→│ │ 12m elapsed  │ │ 3m elapsed   │ │              │    │
   204→│ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘    │
   205→├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
   206→│ ┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐      │
   207→│ │ Pending │ │ In Prog │ │ Review  │ │ Done    │      │
   208→│ │   12    │ │    3    │ │    2    │ │   47    │      │
   209→│ └─────────┘ └─────────┘ └─────────┘ └─────────┘      │
   210→├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
   211→│ RECENT ACTIVITY               │ NEEDS ATTENTION        │
   212→│ ● task-foo completed (2m ago) │ 5 inbox items untriaged│
   213→│ ● task-bar started (5m ago)   │ 3 observations pending │
   214→│ ● PR #42 merged (12m ago)     │ 1 validation warning   │
   215→│ ● task-baz reviewed (15m ago) │ 2 blocked tasks        │
   216→└───────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────┘
   217→```
   218→
   219→**Active Work Row:** Prominently displayed at top. Cards show:
   220→- Task title + slug
   221→- Assigned agent
   222→- Time elapsed (breathing animation border)
   223→- Mini output preview (last 2-3 lines of agent output, like kynetic-internal's MiniTerminal)
   224→- Click → opens session stream view
   225→
   226→**Status Summary:** Clickable cards that navigate to filtered task views.
   227→
   228→**Recent Activity:** Timeline of last N events from session logs.
   229→
   230→**Needs Attention:** Aggregated actionable items with direct links.
   231→
   232→### 4.2 Task Board (Kanban)
   233→
   234→This is the primary working view, inspired by kynetic-internal but adapted for kspec's workflow.
   235→
   236→```
   237→┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   238→│ ACTIVE FLEET (only when agents are working)                │
   239→│ ┌───────────────────┐ ┌───────────────────┐                │
   240→│ │ ● @task-auth      │ │ ● @task-deploy    │                │
   241→│ │ task-worker       │ │ task-worker       │                │
   242→│ │ > Running tests.. │ │ > Editing src/..  │                │
   243→│ │ ▰▰▰▰▰▰▱▱▱▱       │ │ ▰▰▰▱▱▱▱▱▱▱       │                │
   244→│ └───────────────────┘ └───────────────────┘                │
   245→├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
   246→│ Backlog      │ In Progress  │ Review       │ Done          │
   247→│ ┌──────────┐ │ ┌──────────┐ │ ┌──────────┐ │ ┌──────────┐ │
   248→│ │ Task     │ │ │ Task     │ │ │ Task     │ │ │ Task     │ │
   249→│ │ P1 ● cli│ │ │ P2 ● web│ │ │ PR #42   │ │ │ ✓ merged │ │
   250→│ │ @ref     │ │ │ @ref     │ │ │ @ref     │ │ │ @ref     │ │
   251→│ └──────────┘ │ └──────────┘ │ └──────────┘ │ └──────────┘ │
   252→│ ┌──────────┐ │              │              │ ┌──────────┐ │
   253→│ │ Task     │ │              │              │ │ Task     │ │
   254→│ │ P2 ● sch│ │              │              │ │ ✓ merged │ │
   255→│ └──────────┘ │              │              │ └──────────┘ │
   256→└──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────┘
   257→```
   258→
   259→**Column mapping:**
   260→
   261→| Column | Task statuses |
   262→|--------|--------------|
   263→| Backlog | `pending` (automation: unassessed, manual_only) |
   264→| Ready | `pending` (automation: eligible) — ready for pickup |
   265→| In Progress | `in_progress`, `needs_work` |
   266→| Review | `pending_review` |
   267→| Done | `completed` (recent, last 7 days) |
   268→| Blocked | `blocked` (separate section or inline indicator) |
   269→
   270→**Active Fleet Row** (from kynetic-internal pattern):
   271→- Only visible when dispatch agents are actively working
   272→- Shows real-time mini terminal output per task
   273→- Breathing animation on card borders
   274→- Click → expands to full session stream
   275→
   276→**Task Card Design:**
   277→```
   278→┌─────────────────────────┐
   279→│ P1  ● cli  ◆ eligible   │  ← priority, tag chips, automation badge
   280→│ Fix validation edge case │  ← title
   281→│ @task-fix-validation     │  ← slug (monospace, muted)
   282→│ Spec: @item-validation   │  ← spec ref link
   283→│ ─────────────────────── │
   284→│ 2 notes · 1 dep · 3h ago│  ← metadata footer
   285→└─────────────────────────┘
   286→```
   287→
   288→**Task Detail Modal** (click card → modal):
   289→- Full task information: title, description, status, priority, type
   290→- Status badge with transition history
   291→- Spec reference (clickable, shows spec detail inline)
   292→- Tags (editable)
   293→- Dependencies + blocked-by (with status indicators)
   294→- Notes (chronological, with author + timestamp)
   295→- Todos (if any)
   296→- Automation eligibility
   297→- Session history (links to session view)
   298→- Actions: Start, Submit, Complete, Block, Add Note (when daemon connected)
   299→
