   330→
   331→**Enhancements over current:**
   332→- AC coverage indicators (✓ covered / ✕ not / ? unknown) with count
   333→- Trait AC display (inherited ACs from traits, with N/A annotations)
   334→- Quick navigation between spec ↔ linked tasks
   335→- Inline editing of description, tags (when daemon connected)
