   367→### 4.5 Session Stream View
   368→
   369→The key new view for watching agent work in real-time. Inspired by kynetic-internal's ChatPanel + ToolCallView but adapted for kspec's session model.
   370→
   371→```
   372→┌──────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┐
   373→│ SESSION INFO     │ STREAM                                  │
   374→│                  │                                         │
   375→│ ID: 01KJX...    │ ┌─ Agent Message ──────────────────────┐│
   376→│ Agent: worker   │ │ I'll start by reading the spec for   ││
   377→│ Task: @task-auth│ │ the authentication feature...         ││
   378→│ Started: 12m ago│ └──────────────────────────────────────┘│
   379→│ Status: ● active│                                         │
   380→│                  │ ┌─ Tool Call: Read ────────────────────┐│
   381→│ CONTEXT         │ │ 📄 src/auth/login.ts                 ││
   382→│ Spec: @user-auth│ │ Status: ✓ completed (0.3s)           ││
   383→│ ACs to cover:   │ │ [▼ Show output]                      ││
   384→│  ☐ AC-1         │ └──────────────────────────────────────┘│
   385→│  ☐ AC-2         │                                         │
   386→│  ☑ AC-3         │ ┌─ Agent Message ──────────────────────┐│
   387→│                  │ │ Now I'll implement the token refresh ││
   388→│ FILES CHANGED   │ │ logic based on AC-2...               ││
   389→│ src/auth/login.ts│ └──────────────────────────────────────┘│
   390→│ tests/auth.test.│                                         │
   391→│                  │ ┌─ Tool Call: Edit ────────────────────┐│
   392→│ BUDGET          │ │ ✏️  src/auth/token.ts                 ││
   393→│ 1/3 tasks       │ │ Status: ● running...                 ││
   394→│                  │ │ [Streaming diff...]                  ││
   395→│                  │ └──────────────────────────────────────┘│
   396→│                  │                                         │
   397→│                  │ ┌─ Thinking ───────────────────────────┐│
   398→│                  │ │ 💭 Considering edge cases for...     ││
   399→│                  │ │ [▼ Expand reasoning]                 ││
   400→│                  │ └──────────────────────────────────────┘│
   401→└──────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┘
   402→```
   403→
   404→**Stream message types (from kynetic-internal's AggregatedMessage):**
   405→- **Agent messages** — Markdown rendered, syntax highlighted code blocks
   406→- **Tool calls** — Collapsible with icon per tool type, input/output, timing
   407→- **Thinking blocks** — Collapsed by default, expandable
   408→- **User messages** — If any (dispatch prompt context)
   409→
   410→**Left sidebar context panel:**
   411→- Session metadata
   412→- Spec context with AC checklist (checked as agent covers them)
   413→- Files changed during session
   414→- Budget info
   415→- Link to task detail
   416→
   417→**Auto-scroll behavior** (from kynetic-internal):
   418→- Auto-scroll follows new content
   419→- Pauses when user scrolls up (>100px from bottom)
   420→- Resumes when scrolled back to bottom
   421→- "Jump to bottom" floating button when paused
