   560→## 5. Component Architecture
   561→
   562→### 5.1 Design System Layer (`lib/ds/`)
   563→
   564→Port from imgen, adapted for kspec:
   565→
   566→```
   567→lib/ds/
   568→├── tokens.css              # CSS custom properties (oklch colors, spacing, radii)
   569→├── reset.css               # Minimal reset
   570→├── typography.css           # Font families, fluid sizes, text utilities
   571→├── animations.css           # Keyframes (breathe, shimmer, emerge)
   572→├── Card.svelte             # Base card with status variant
   573→├── Badge.svelte            # Status/tag/priority badges
   574→├── Button.svelte           # Primary/secondary/ghost/destructive variants
   575→├── Input.svelte            # Text input with label/error states
   576→├── Modal.svelte            # Full modal with header/body/footer slots
